TASK [ipsec_pq_mlkem : Note what "optional" costs you] *************************
ok: [r1] => {
    "msg": "pq_key_exchange_optional is true, so a peer that cannot do mlkem768 falls back to classical DH and the tunnel still comes up, with no syslog to tell you. verify.yml reads the pqc-group leaf per SA; pqc-gt-none there means you are not protected. Set pq_key_exchange_optional to false in group_vars/all/pqc.yml once every peer is upgraded."
}
